OL,3,GNEWSALook North sofa takes on the Peak
OL,4,ADistrict
OL,5,
OL,6,FGarcia joked they were "still smiling,
OL,7,Fjust about", but "at the point of
OL,8,Fdelirium" before finishing the leg in
OL,9,FBurngreave and Wincobank on Wednesday
OL,10,Fevening.
